          "description": "Natural disaster cover status for cancellation, additional expenses or travel delay benefits at plan level. Use included where the plan covers natural disaster events without extra premium, optional_add_on where a natural-disaster upgrade must be purchased, conditionally_included where only some sections or specified circumstances are covered, excluded where natural disasters are not covered, not_applicable where the plan has no relevant benefits, or unknown. Capture section-specific differences in coverage_benefits or optional_add_ons.",
